Choose $\varepsilon>0$ and consider the function
\begin{equation}
\Xi^{m,n}_{\varepsilon}(x)=\int_{\varepsilon}^{x}f^{(n)}(\xi_2-x)\int_{\varepsilon}^{\xi_2}f^{(m)}(\xi_1)\mathrm{d}\xi_1\mathrm{d}\xi_2,
